// - the quick area is Square's three checkout tabs, Keypad (a custom amount), Library (every item, with search) and
//   Favorites (a grid), under a quantity bar that sets how many the next tap adds;
// - a line is tapped to change its quantity, override its price, give it a percent off, take its tax off or add a
